The '''Living Timecharm''' is a {{Special}} [[Rift Timecharms|Rift Timecharm]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Recipe Table
|{{Crafting Recipe Row
 |A1 = Living Metal, 20 |B1 = Living Metal, 20 |C1 = Living Metal, 20
 |A2 = Living Metal, 20 |B2 = Frosty Crux, 20  |C2 = Living Metal, 20
 |A3 = Living Metal, 20 |B3 = Living Metal, 20 |C3 = Living Metal, 20
 |Output = Living Timecharm
 }}
}}

== Usage ==
The player can secure the '''Living Timecharm''' in the {{zone|Rift Gallery}} to gain {{SkyBlock XP|+100}} and unlock access to the {{zone|Colosseum (Rift)}}.

=== Game Message ===
Securing the '''Living Timecharm''' will result in the following message, which will be broadcast to the entire lobby:
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|&d&lRIFTASTIC! &7[player] &ehas secured &cLiving Timecharm&e into their gallery! &6gg&e!}}}}
=== Rift Necklace ===
{{Main|Rift Necklace}}
Securing the '''Living Timecharm''' will add additional [[stats]] to the [[Rift Necklace]] both inside and outside the [[Rift Dimension]].

